To ease notation in the following proofs, we write 
$(u,v) = (w_1, w_2) = \bigr(\Phi(z_1), \Phi(z_2)\bigl)$,
\begin{align} 
	W_1^{(i)} := U_{j_e|D_e}^{(i)}, \;   W_2^{(i)} := U_{k_e|D_e}^{(i)}, \;   Z_1^{(i)} := \Phi^{-1}\bigl(U_{j_e|D_e}^{(i)}\bigr), \;   Z_2^{(i)} := \Phi^{-1}\bigl(U_{k_e|D_e}^{(i)}\bigr).
